  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "html": "误差不在你的代码里，在二进制里"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "上一课看到 <code>0.1 + 0.2</code> 得到 <code>0.30000000000000004</code>。这一课把这件事拆到底：误差从哪来、什么时候可以忽略、什么时候必须换工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "先看清误差有多大"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c1",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "print(0.1 + 0.2)\nprint(f\"{0.1 + 0.2:.17f}\")\nprint(0.1 + 0.2 - 0.3)",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "0.30000000000000004\n0.30000000000000004\n5.551115123125783e-17"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "误差是 <code>5.5e-17</code>，也就是小数点后第 16 位。<strong>这个量级对绝大多数计算毫无影响</strong>——真正的问题是很多人用 <code>==</code> 去比较它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "比较浮点数：用 isclose，不要用 =="
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c2",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "import math\n\na = 0.1 + 0.2\nprint(a == 0.3)\nprint(math.isclose(a, 0.3))\nprint(math.isclose(a, 0.3, rel_tol=0, abs_tol=1e-12))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "False\nTrue\nTrue"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>isclose</code> 默认用相对误差 <code>1e-09</code>。当数值本身接近 0 时相对误差会失效（除以 0），所以它还提供 <code>abs_tol</code> 兜底。这也是为什么\"自己写 <code>abs(a-b) &lt; 1e-9</code>\"往往是错的——对 <code>1e-12</code> 这种数值，绝对误差阈值比数本身还大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "warn",
      "title": "排序和去重也会被误差影响",
      "html": "<code>sorted</code> 用的是 <code>&lt;</code>，两个\"理论上相等\"的浮点数可能因为末位不同而排序结果不稳定。需要确定性时，先量化到固定小数位再比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "三个必须换工具的场景"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "head": [
        "场景",
        "别用",
        "用什么"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "金额、账目",
          "<code>float</code>",
          "<code>decimal.Decimal</code>（从字符串构造）"
        ],
        [
          "精确分数（1/3 这种）",
          "<code>float</code>",
          "<code>fractions.Fraction</code>"
        ],
        [
          "判断两个浮点\"差不多\"",
          "<code>==</code>",
          "<code>math.isclose</code>"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c3",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "from decimal import Decimal\nfrom fractions import Fraction\n\nprint(Decimal(\"0.1\") + Decimal(\"0.2\"))\nprint(Decimal(\"1.10\") * Decimal(\"3\"))\nprint(Fraction(1, 3) + Fraction(1, 6))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "0.3\n3.30\n1/2"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>Decimal</code> 会保留末尾的 0（<code>3.30</code>），这在账目里是有意义的——它表示精度到分。<code>Fraction</code> 保持分数形式，<code>1/3 + 1/6</code> 精确等于 <code>1/2</code>。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "打印时怎么控制显示"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c4",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "value = 1 / 3\nprint(value)\nprint(f\"{value:.4f}\")\nprint(format(value, \".2%\"))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "0.3333333333333333\n0.3333\n33.33%"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "格式化只影响<strong>显示</strong>，不改变存储的值。想要\"存进去就是两位小数\"，得用 <code>Decimal.quantize</code>，而不是格式化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "question": "判断两个计算出来的浮点数是否相等，最稳妥的写法是？",
      "options": [
        "a == b",
        "abs(a - b) &lt; 1e-9",
        "math.isclose(a, b)",
        "round(a, 9) == round(b, 9)"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explain": "isclose 同时考虑相对误差与绝对误差，能适应不同量级。固定阈值 1e-9 在数值很小时会误判为相等、在数值很大时又可能误判为不等；round 则在边界处仍可能翻转。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "小结"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "误差来自二进制表示，量级约 1e-16，正常计算可以忽略。",
        "比较用 <code>math.isclose</code>，别用 <code>==</code>，也别自己拍一个固定阈值。",
        "钱用 <code>Decimal</code>（从字符串构造），分数用 <code>Fraction</code>。",
        "格式化只改显示，不改存储；要改精度用 <code>quantize</code>。"
      ]
    }
  ],
